      "en": "The child Samuel ministered to the LORD before Eli. The LORD’s word was rare in those days. There were not many visions, then.",
      "ko": "아이 사무엘이 엘리 앞에서 여호와를 섬길 때에는 여호와의 말씀이 희귀하여 이상이 흔히 보이지 않았더라",
      "source_text_hash": "c6ddbb203d5ff4ac956ee1bba2bd4176583f8d9a14f7704506f803a6e3ebf853",
      "translation_text_hash": "860f70b5595c4f5699cbf1b5ccdb2a3f4ffd4cd07f0627a7afb6b17947d6ef37",
